INSERT INTO quizzes (title, description, level, time_limit, status, created_at, updated_at) VALUES ('A wildlife boat tour', 'Read the following text and choose the correct answer for each gap [1] - [6]:\n\nWhen I was on holiday with my parents, we went on a wildlife tour. The trip involved sailing round some islands off the coast, not too far [1] our hotel. Some other guests had been on the tour, and recommended it to my parents, who immediately decided we should go.\n\nIn the morning our guide, Jake, picked us [2] in his boat and off we went. Jake knew lots about the wildlife on the islands and we saw everything we were hoping to, apart from one bird, called a harrier, which didn’t appear. But that didn’t matter [3] we saw many other amazing birds.\n\nMy parents especially liked the fact that [4] were very few people on the tour. Jake had time to answer all our questions, so we felt we learnt [5] than we’d expected. And we agreed this wildlife experience was [6] of the best we’d ever had.', 'A2', 360, 'PUBLISHED', NOW(), NOW());
