INSERT INTO quizzes (title, description, level, time_limit, status, created_at, updated_at) VALUES ('My city', 'Read the following text and choose the correct answer for each gap [1] - [6]:\n\nby Harry Salter\n\nDo you live in a nice place? I do! The city [1] I live is called Bristol, and it’s in the south west of England. It’s not very big, but there are loads of things for teenagers to do here.\n\n[2] you’re interested in television, you should go to the Bristol TV and Radio Studios. On the tour of the studios, you can have a go at presenting and appear [3] your own radio drama.\n\nOr if you’re into sport, why [4] try canoeing? The best place is a very pretty local section of the Kennet and Avon canal. It connects Bristol to London and it [5] built in the early 18th century, so you can experience some local history at the same time.\n\nThese are just two [6] the many things you can do here. It really is a great place.', 'A2', 360, 'PUBLISHED', NOW(), NOW());
