INSERT INTO quizzes (title, description, level, time_limit, status, created_at, updated_at) VALUES ('College careers fair', 'Read the following text and choose the correct answer for each gap [1] - [8]:\n\nLast week, I went with forty students on my college course to attend a careers fair in the capital city. During the coach journey most of [1] either slept or listened to music, and four hours later we arrived [2] the careers fair. [3] the early departure and long journey it was definitely worth going, as we all found the fair really exciting and interesting. [4] were around sixty education and job stalls, and so much careers information available. I am keen [5] learning as much as possible about business and hope to open [6] own health food company one day, so I also went to a short talk about how [7] start up a business. I returned to college with several brochures [8] are full of facts and helpful advice. If any students are thinking of going to next year’s fair, I would definitely recommend it!', 'A2', 480, 'PUBLISHED', NOW(), NOW());
