INSERT INTO quizzes (title, description, level, time_limit, status, created_at, updated_at) VALUES ('An Irish cookery school', 'Read the following text and choose the correct answer for each gap [1] - [9]:\n\nIn the last few years, a number of cookery schools have been set [1] in Ireland to promote Irish cooking.  [2] such school is run by Kathleen Doyle not [3] from the centre of Dublin.\n\n‘I opened the school twelve years ago,’ says Kathleen.  ‘The school was by no means an overnight success; I found [4] necessary to work hard to build up a reputation.  One of my advantages was that I’d had problems with my own cooking.  I’ve made [5] mistake that it’s possible to make, but [6] of this, I know what people do wrong from first-hand experience.’ \n\nJust [7] most cookery schools in Ireland, Kathleen initially copied the classical dishes of France and Italy and other countries [8] have a reputation for excellent food.  ‘Now though, things are changing,’ says Kathleen.  ‘We get excellent produce from Irish farms and, [9] a result, we’re encouraging students to create unique Irish dishes.’', 'B1', 540, 'PUBLISHED', NOW(), NOW());
