INSERT INTO quizzes (title, description, level, time_limit, status, created_at, updated_at) VALUES ('Kangaroos', 'Read the following text and choose the correct answer for each gap [1] - [11]:\n\nKangaroos [1] found in the wild only in Australia and its surrounding islands. There are several species of kangaroo but the best known are the large red, grey and antilopine kangaroos. They all have large feet and extremely strong back legs as [2] as a long tail, and can grow [3] to 1.6 metres tall. They tend to jump rather [4] walk because their large feet make walking difficult.\n\nThe one fact that almost [5] knows about kangaroos is that young kangaroos, joeys, live in a kind of pocket at the front of their mother’s body. [6] they may come out of the pocket to play or explore, the pocket is [7] they live for many months after their birth.\n\nKangaroos feed [8] grasses, leaves, flowers and moss. They live in groups known as mobs and protect one [9] from danger. They present [10] real threat to human beings and have attacked people only [11] they have been provoked.', 'B1', 660, 'PUBLISHED', NOW(), NOW());
