INSERT INTO quizzes (title, description, level, time_limit, status, created_at, updated_at) VALUES ('Collecting stamps', 'Read the following text and choose the correct answer for each gap [1] - [11]:\n\nEver since postage stamps were first issued, people have [1] collecting stamps. At [2] this was regarded as just a hobby for children. Many people, though, continue collecting stamps throughout the whole of [3] life. Although the pastime is no [4] as widespread as it once was, it remains [5] of the most popular hobbies, with many millions of people worldwide collecting stamps.\n\nThe collections people make vary. Some want to obtain [6] stamp ever issued by a particular country. Others, though, are more interested in the pictures on stamps and collect as [7] stamps as possible which have, for example, a picture of a bird or maybe of an aeroplane.\n\nIt is [8] doubt very satisfying for a collector to complete his collection. However, in many cases this never happens [9] new stamps are being issued [10] the time. This may seem frustrating but it means that people can carry [11] collecting for as long as their interest lasts.', 'B1', 660, 'PUBLISHED', NOW(), NOW());
