INSERT INTO quizzes (title, description, level, time_limit, status, created_at, updated_at) VALUES ('Is there any such thing as a free tour?', 'Read the following text and choose the correct answer for each gap [1] - [9]:\n\nTourists are accustomed [1] paying high prices for city tours.  However, the concept of a free tour with [2] set charge, for which tourists show their appreciation by giving only a tip, [3]  becoming increasingly popular in many places.\n\nOf course, the word ‘free’ is loosely employed [4] a marketing tactic, and those who take tours [5] these know full well that they are expected to hand over cash when the tour ends.  For the guide, such tours can be surprisingly lucrative, and for the tourist the advantage is obvious; you only pay  [6] you think the tour is worth.  As one guide explains, ‘If people have paid in advance for something, they tend to complain more – even [7] things that are beyond our control, like the weather! [8] I started leading free tours, I’ve noticed that complaints are much rarer.  Occasionally you get people leaving [9] giving anything, but that’s something you have to live with!’', 'B2', 540, 'PUBLISHED', NOW(), NOW());
