INSERT INTO quizzes (title, description, level, time_limit, status, created_at, updated_at) VALUES ('‘Comfort’ reading', 'Read the following text and choose the correct answer for each gap [1] - [9]:\n\nFor many people, books are [1] friends who are always there for us. [2] a rainy day, they give us exactly the right kind of pleasure. ‘Books provide people [3] the opportunity for social connection and the joy of being part of something larger than oneself for a [4] moments,’ according to a recent study. The study also found that we can derive a similar amount of satisfaction from feeling that we belong to a fictional world [5] we can from a real life group.\n\nSo what then makes a good ‘comfort’ read? It’s very difficult to generalise except for the fact that it is intensely personal. [6] matter what the genre is, it’s important that, in the end, justice prevails.\n\nAnd a ‘comfort’ read book is [7] that’s capable of [8] read over and over again. It is, after [9], possible to find something new in a book however many times you read it, but the words themselves never change and never let us down.', 'B2', 540, 'PUBLISHED', NOW(), NOW());
