INSERT INTO quizzes (title, description, level, time_limit, status, created_at, updated_at) VALUES ('Discovering New Material', 'Read the following text and choose the correct answer for each gap [1] - [9]:\n\nVulcanised rubber, celluloid and plastic – these materials were, [1] a certain degree, invented by accident. In fact, the history of materials can be described [2] a history of accidents, but this is not as catastrophic as it sounds. [3] the beginning of scientific investigation, scientists have stumbled across new and wonderful materials in [4] course of exploring something completely different. But this chance discovery of useful materials [5] undergoing a change.\n\nScientists sitting at their desks, now turn to computers to design materials and to work out their properties long [6] they need to go anywhere near a laboratory. But the element of chance is still present as the ultimate application of these new materials remains tentative. [7] scientists are confident about is that each has the potential to be revolutionary. The race is now on to make these materials reality. [8] the history of materials is any guide, how we eventually use them will, [9] part, be discovered accidentally.', 'B2', 540, 'PUBLISHED', NOW(), NOW());
