INSERT INTO quizzes (title, description, level, time_limit, status, created_at, updated_at) VALUES ('My First Paddle-Boarding Lesson', 'Read the following text and choose the correct answer for each gap [1] - [9]:\n\nHere I am in a cold, windy city, [1] a very grey sky. I ask myself [2] I’m standing on an oversized surfboard in the middle of a river with nothing to help me [3] a paddle. I’m about to have my first lesson in paddle-boarding, which is a bit [4] canoeing but with only one paddle and, being upright, you can enjoy the views on offer. The teacher reassures me it’s easy, which [5] nothing to reduce the pressure. I desperately try to keep [6] balance and concentrate on not falling in. I wonder if I’ve left it too late to back out and head for solid ground, but before I can change my mind I’m [7] the move, but not going where I want to. I hear my teacher shouting ‘Paddle paddle’; I try but, [8] my best efforts, I don’t make much progress. ‘You need to paddle on both sides,’ he says, ‘because [9] you’ll go around in circles. Copy me.’ And finally I’m moving in the same direction as everyone else and it feels amazing.', 'B2', 540, 'PUBLISHED', NOW(), NOW());
