INSERT INTO quizzes (title, description, level, time_limit, status, created_at, updated_at) VALUES ('Handwriting is history', 'Read the following text and choose the correct answer for each gap [1] - [9]:\n\nHandwriting has been [1] for about 6,000 years, just a small fraction of the time that humans have been on this earth, but its effects have been enormous. Writing doesn’t come naturally to us; [2] seeing and hearing, it must be taught.\n\nHowever, [3] that computers have taken over our world, the need to write anything by hand is becoming redundant. Some educationalists are therefore questioning why schools should teach joined-up writing at [4] . It takes up a lot of teaching time that could otherwise be devoted [5] keyboard skills. But these experts admit that handwriting [6] indeed have a presence that is absent in typed prose.\n\nMany of us rebel [7] the radical idea of abandoning writing by hand because we think that our personal identity shines through in our handwriting. It allows self-expression to grow and is regarded by many [8] the mark of a civilised society. So, are we really ready to enter a world [9] the artistic flow of handwritten script might be about to disappear?', 'B2', 540, 'PUBLISHED', NOW(), NOW());
