INSERT INTO quizzes (title, description, level, time_limit, status, created_at, updated_at) VALUES ('Beekeeping at school', 'Read the following text and choose the correct answer for each gap [1] - [9]:\n\nWhen a swarm of bees descended on a primary school one day, [1] surprisingly there was panic among the teachers. Most of the children, [2] , watched fascinated as a bee catcher rounded [3] the uninvited visitors. This unexpected event led to the school getting its own bee hive a year later and integrating beekeeping into the curriculum, all of [4] has resulted in notable benefits. \n\nThe children study the dance that the bees do to communicate where nectar [5] to be found and use honey in cooking lessons. They have even opened a school shop selling honey, with the pupils responsible for collecting and pricing it, as well as every other step of production. \n\nInterestingly, nobody anticipated the most significant benefit of [6] of this: the effect bees seem to [7] had on the pupils’ behaviour. [8] getting children to think of their responsibility to others can often [9] a challenge, making bees the focus has brought about this behaviour effortlessly.', 'B2', 540, 'PUBLISHED', NOW(), NOW());
