INSERT INTO quizzes (title, description, level, time_limit, status, created_at, updated_at) VALUES ('Underground homes – the alternative green home architecture', 'Read the following text and choose the correct answer for each gap [1] - [9]:\n\nIf we’re asked to picture an underground home, what probably comes [1] mind is a fantasy dwelling from a film such as The Lord of the Rings. We’re perhaps far [2] likely to think of realistic contemporary architecture. [3] a matter of fact, homes in [4] some or all of the structure is constructed underground are rapidly gaining popularity. Each design is unique, depending on the soil type, climate, landscape and owner’s requirements.\n\nSo why do people choose underground homes? [5] doubt, these houses are warmer and easier to heat than conventional houses. Also, their construction makes use [6] many materials found on or near the building site. This reduces transportation costs by a significant amount. Last [7] not least, labour costs are lower as underground homes can be constructed rapidly. \n\nIn [8] of these benefits, some people feel uncomfortable underground [9] or not the house has windows on the external walls. Ventilation is also an issue due to the fact that it’s very difficult to create a natural air flow.', 'B2', 540, 'PUBLISHED', NOW(), NOW());
