INSERT INTO quizzes (title, description, level, time_limit, status, created_at, updated_at) VALUES ('Life’s dilemmas', 'Read the following text and choose the correct answer for each gap [1] - [9]:\n\nImagine this situation: a colleague who hates her job [1] the announcement she’s leaving to travel the world. Do you congratulate her, or tell her that running away is not the answer – she should [2] put and deal with her issues?  While there’s no shortage of guidance available recommending we achieve our goals by changing our situation, an equal amount champions trying to change ourselves instead. It’s not always possible to have what we want [3] we want it, so sometimes we should [4] up to the situation and learn to make the [5] of things. On the other hand, sometimes the right thing to do is to [6] steps to change the situation. How do we know [7] to focus our energies on that or on changing ourselves? Most important is a bit of self-examination; is the dissatisfaction really rooted [8] the situation, or could being in a better frame of mind help us to cope? Above all, as is so [9] the case, the self-knowledge is the key to our dilemmas.', 'C1', 540, 'PUBLISHED', NOW(), NOW());
