INSERT INTO quizzes (title, description, level, time_limit, status, created_at, updated_at) VALUES ('The quest for extra-terrestrial life', 'Read the following text and choose the correct answer for each gap [1] - [9]:\n\nThe search for extra-terrestrial intelligence has, [1] yet, found not a whisper. But [2] to recent technological developments, we may now be [3] the verge of being able to search for life beyond our solar system. However, given the vast distances between the Earth and even the nearest stars, the discovery of alien life is unlikely to lead to very [4] of a dialogue since there would be a huge time delay between each message.\n\nIf we do make contact with alien life at [5] point, it may reveal itself accidentally through distinctive chemical blends in the atmospheres of other planets which cannot have been produced by purely geological processes.\n\nWe have often imagined alien life as being [6] our own image; or if [7] entirely human, then at least bearing some resemblance to a terrestrial life form. Our preoccupation with the search for water is no [8] than a reflection of the fact that life on Earth cannot exist without it. But why should alien life be at [9] like us?', 'C1', 540, 'PUBLISHED', NOW(), NOW());
