INSERT INTO quizzes (title, description, level, time_limit, status, created_at, updated_at) VALUES ('Computer games come real', 'Read the following text and choose the correct answer for each gap [1] - [11]:\n\nPeople are talking about a new craze which involves being locked in a room. Room escape games are immersive real-life experiences [1] players are voluntarily locked in a room filled with cryptic puzzles that [2] to be solved in order to effect an escape. [3] the games first appeared around the turn of the century, their popularity has snowballed over the past few years. \n\nI recently visited the room which was the original venue for the game, now just [4] of hundreds opening in cities all over the world. The founder of the enterprise explained [5] accounts for the game’s success – once I’d managed to escape, [6] is. He told me that he put its popularity [7] to the fact that it’s more fun to try games in real life than online.\n\nNew venues continue to open throughout Europe, with tourists clamouring to give them a try. [8] they will ever [9] to be viewed with the same regard [10] a city’s more traditional attractions or not, they seem to provide a welcome alternative for the [11] being.', 'C1', 660, 'PUBLISHED', NOW(), NOW());
